<Base title="About" description="About William Nisbett and this site.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>I'm William. Most people call me Billy.</p>
  <p>I did a master's in physics at the University of Houston working on X-ray imaging, then spent a few years doing scientific ML for pharmaceutical manufacturing at Capgemini, three years on ad recommender systems at Yelp, a year as founding AI engineer at Electric Twin, and now lead the computer vision data platform team at Augmodo. I also have a degree in Chinese Studies, which explains the paintings.</p>
  <p>I'm a US citizen living in London. I work remotely with US teams and travel over roughly monthly.</p>

  <h2>This site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, hosted on GitHub Pages, no analytics.</li>
    <li>Set in Crimson Pro. The background is cosmic latte, the average colour of the universe, borrowed from <a href="https://zhengdongwang.com">Zhengdong Wang</a>.</li>
    <li>Everything here is my own opinion and not my employer's.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
